ICML-2023-P0890,ICML-2023-A003897,Jingren Zhou,stacked,2,2,9,"Subject (Person) Person + Object Person + Objects + Background Subject (Object) Subject (Background) (a) Reference images (b) Images generated by concatenating subject-specific concept neurons Figure . We explore the subject-specific concept neurons in a pre-trained text-to-image diffusion model. Concatenating multiple clusters of concept neurons representing different persons, objects, and backgrounds can flexibly generate all related concepts in a single image.",-6,data/raw/icml/2023/first_pages/ICML-2023-P0890.txt,https://proceedings.mlr.press/v202/liu23j/liu23j.pdf
